{"id":"637375","name":"皮蛋拌豆腐","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/637375/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"内酯豆腐","amount":"半份"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"小许"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"一个"},{"name":"子姜","amount":"15g"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"10g"},{"name":"寿司醋","amount":"3g"},{"name":"香油","amount":"小许"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"内酯豆腐取一半。","img":"images/637375/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切片冷水下锅。","img":"images/637375/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮开2分钟。","img":"images/637375/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/637375/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洗净香菜和小米辣切末。","img":"images/637375/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"洗净子姜切末。","img":"images/637375/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"子姜和部分香菜末放碗里，放生抽。","img":"images/637375/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放寿司醋和食盐，拌匀。","img":"images/637375/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"皮蛋洗净。","img":"images/637375/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"去壳切块。","img":"images/637375/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放豆腐上。","img":"images/637375/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取料汁。","img":"images/637375/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"浇上料汁。","img":"images/637375/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"撒香菜和小米辣即可。","img":"images/637375/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}